<div class="WordSection1">Hi,<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Freight.<br />
<br />
We understand you would like to cancel your pet booking.<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
Flights are completely refundable (excluding any telephone booking fee that may have applied) if it's cancelled 14 days or more before the scheduled departure date.<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
Cancellations made less than 14 days are not refundable.<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
As your flight is within 14&nbsp;days or more it is not eligible for a refund, according to our policy.<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
Please let us know if you require any further assistance.<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
Kind Regards,<br />
&nbsp;<br clear="none" />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
<br clear="none" />
<strong>Customer Service</strong>&nbsp;<br />
Qantas Freight<br clear="none" />
